// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x004F5AED size=59 name=?removeSupplyCenter@ResourceGatheringManager@@QAEXPAVObject@@@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=B hypothesis:Z
void ResourceGatheringManager::removeSupplyCenter(Object *center)
{
	if (center == 0)
		return;
	ObjectID targetID = center->getID();
	_STL::list<ObjectID>::iterator iter = m_supplyCenters.begin();
	while (iter != m_supplyCenters.end())
	{
		if (targetID == *iter)
			iter = m_supplyCenters.erase(iter);
		else
			++iter;
	}
}

